    "exp.label": "Experience",
    "exp.title.1": "Making complex things clear",
    "exp.title.2": "in Fintech, Edtech and B2B products",
    "exp.1.role": "Senior Product Designer • Mar 2025 — Present",
    "exp.1.text": "Design complex web & mobile solutions for different user roles on an Edtech platform for private schools. Actively develop and contribute to the design system. Designed the MVP of a web platform for kindergarten teachers from scratch, now live. Launched AI-assisted assignment review: among early-adopter teachers, average review session time fell by 37.8%.",
    "exp.2.company": "VTB",
    "exp.2.role": "Product Designer • Oct 2022 — Mar 2025",
    "exp.2.text": "Designed mobile banking services for one of Russia’s top 3 banks, focusing on its B2B mobile banking app for SMEs. Led the Multibank service from MVP and contributed to the design system and design processes in the company. Contributed to a 2.8% growth in the app’s overall client base. Mentored new designers through onboarding sessions.",
    "exp.3.role": "UX/UI Designer • Dec 2021 — Sep 2022",
    "exp.3.text": "Collaborated on web & mobile design in a cross-functional team working on pre-sales projects. Conducted user research, including in-depth interviews and usability testing, and created wireframes and interactive prototypes for product pitches. Helped win a client contract through a design-led presale demo of Guide You.",
    "exp.4.role": "Designer • Jun 2020 — Dec 2021",
    "exp.4.text": "As the sole designer, I owned the company’s entire digital experience, from UX/UI and visual identity to content, SEO and website development. Initiated user research and designed a mobile app based on the findings, taking it from initial research to a stakeholder presentation and approval for further development. After I launched the new website, which I designed, built on WordPress and optimized for SEO myself, monthly active users grew nearly 10x and conversion rose from 1.3% to 4.5%; 89% of surveyed users were fully satisfied with it.",

